WEBVTT

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:01.760
Is this a pyramid scheme,
what do you want, what are you selling?"

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:06.816
But most people were surprisingly moved.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:10.616
I remember, I called the woman
who does the pest control

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.816
for the warehouse
where my coffee is served --

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:16.416
I'm sorry -- where my coffee is stored.

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:18.896
And I said,

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.416
"This may sound strange,

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:24.816
but I want to thank you
for keeping the bugs out of my coffee."

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:27.456
And she said, "Well,
that does sound strange,

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.576
but you just made my day."

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:33.176
And it was like an anti-crank phone call.